@ref s 423.1(3) (src:7539-7540)
GIVEN `the person contravenes section 423.1, by s 423.1(1)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 423.1(3) the person is guilty of an offence for contravening section 423.1` MEANS
    `the person contravenes section 423.1, by s 423.1(1)`   -- JUST TRUE when it is contravened; NOTHING carried from the prohibition's own limit

@ref s 423.1(3) (the punishments) (src:7539-7540)
