-- 424 Every person who threatens to commit an offence under section 235, 236, 266, 267, 268, 269, 269.1, 271, 272, 273, 279 or 279.1 against an internationally protected person or who threatens to commit an offence under section 431
-- is guilty of (a) an indictable offence ... five years; or (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction. Offences are tested by section number (seam rule R1).
-- src:7575 | Threat against internationally protected person
-- src:7576 | 424 Every person who threatens to commit an offence under section 235, 236, 266, 267, 268, 269, 269.1, 271, 272, 273, 279 or 279.1 against an internationally protected person or who threatens to commit an offence under section 431 is guilty of
-- src:7577 | (a) an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than five years; or
-- src:7578 | (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction.
@ref s 424 (src:7575-7578)
GIVEN `the person threatens to commit the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offence threatened` IS A `Provision of the Code`
      `the person threatened is an internationally protected person, by s 2 internationally protected person` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 424 the conduct is the offence of a threat against an internationally protected person` MEANS
    IF `the person threatens to commit the offence`
    THEN `ccc13 any of` (LIST `ccc13 all of` (LIST JUST (   `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 235 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 236 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 266
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 267 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 268 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 269
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 269.1 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 271 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 272
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 273 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 279 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 279.1)
                                                    , `the person threatened is an internationally protected person, by s 2 internationally protected person`)
                          , JUST (`the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 431))
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Every person who threatens to commit an offence under section 235, 236, 266, 267, 268, 269, 269.1, 271, 272, 273, 279 or 279.1 against an internationally protected person"

@ref s 424 (the punishments) (src:7575-7578)
GIVEN `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
GIVETH A LIST OF Punishment
`s 424 the punishments` MEANS LIST
    (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` `five years`, `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)   -- limb 1: the limb the text states
    , `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction`   -- limb 2: the text states no penalty: s 787(1)

@ref s 424 (the class of the offence) (src:7575-7578)
GIVETH A `Class of offence`
`s 424 the class of the offence` MEANS `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`

-- 424.1 Every person who, with intent to compel any person, group of persons, state or any international or intergovernmental organization to do or refrain from doing any act, threatens to commit an offence under section 235, ... or 279.1 against a member of United Nations personnel or associated personnel
-- or threatens to commit an offence under section 431.1 is guilty of (a) ... ten years; or (b) summary conviction. "with intent to compel" is read as governing both threats (fork F11).
-- src:7579 | Threat against United Nations or associated personnel
-- src:7580 | 424.1 Every person who, with intent to compel any person, group of persons, state or any international or intergovernmental organization to do or refrain from doing any act, threatens to commit an offence under section 235, 236, 266, 267, 268, 269, 269.1, 271, 272, 273, 279 or 279.1 against a member of United Nations personnel or associated personnel or threatens to commit an offence under section 431.1 is guilty of
-- src:7581 | (a) an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 10 years; or
-- src:7582 | (b) an offence punishable on summary conviction.
@ref s 424.1 (src:7579-7582)
GIVEN `the person threatens to commit the offence` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person acts with intent to compel any person, group of persons, state or any international or intergovernmental organization to do or refrain from doing any act` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the offence threatened` IS A `Provision of the Code`
      `the person threatened is a member of United Nations personnel, by s 2 United Nations personnel` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person threatened is associated personnel, by s 2 associated personnel` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 424.1 the conduct is the offence of a threat against United Nations or associated personnel` MEANS
    IF `the person threatens to commit the offence` AND `the person acts with intent to compel any person, group of persons, state or any international or intergovernmental organization to do or refrain from doing any act`
    THEN `ccc13 any of` (LIST `ccc13 all of` (LIST JUST (   `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 235 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 236 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 266
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 267 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 268 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 269
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 269.1 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 271 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 272
                                                         OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 273 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 279 OR `the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 279.1)
                                                    , `ccc13 any of` (LIST `the person threatened is a member of United Nations personnel, by s 2 United Nations personnel`, `the person threatened is associated personnel, by s 2 associated personnel`))
                          , JUST (`the offence threatened`'s section EQUALS 431.1))
    ELSE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Every person who, with intent to compel any person, group of persons, state or any international or intergovernmental organization to do or refrain from doing any act, threatens to commit an offence"

@ref s 424.1 (the punishments) (src:7579-7582)
GIVEN `s 787(1) the general penalty for an offence punishable on summary conviction` IS A Punishment
